// 916:523
[com_523]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_0
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=Open up the crew list to assign captains and crew to your current boat.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=3
textalignv=1
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd
opkey11=0,1,0

// 916:524
[com_524]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_1
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=A ship can't sail without a captain. Click this one or drag it to the captain's spot on the roster above to assign it.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=3
textalignv=1
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd
opkey11=0,1,0

// 916:525
[com_525]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_2
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=Our ship could sail, but the chance it'll succeed could be improved by adding crew; either drag them to a spot on the ship, or select the spot you wish to fill then click the crewman to assign them.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=3
textalignv=1
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd
opkey11=0,1,0

// 916:526
[com_526]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_5
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=You can change your ship's stats by equipping new components. Click on the "Deck Items 2" hotspot to see what you can equip.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=3
textalignv=1
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd
opkey11=0,1,0

// 916:527
[com_527]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_7
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=We could do with some more Seafaring, which we can get by swapping the currently equipped Small Crate of Food for some Weathered Rigging. Click on "Weathered Rigging" to see its stats.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=3
textalignv=1
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd
opkey11=0,1,0

// 916:528
[com_528]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_10
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
text=Looks like you're ready - the voyage has an excellent chance of success. Click here to send it on its way.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=3
textalignv=1
